### Directory Structure
```
Demo
├── scripts
│   └── fusesoc
│   └── edalize
└── ip
    └── bus
    └── core
    └── prim
    └── lint
    └── pe
    └── soc
```

### prereqs
```
verilator https://verilator.org/guide/latest/install.html
gtkwave http://gtkwave.sourceforge.net/
cocotb https://docs.cocotb.org/en/stable/install.html
```

### Development methodology

The repository coding, FuseSoC, verification, documentation, generation, and
AI-assisted review workflow is defined in
[`docs/development-manual.md`](docs/development-manual.md). The manual marks
each interface as available, manual, or planned while the environment is being
built.
